.\" Manpage for webpage2pdf.
.TH WEBPAGE2PDF 1 "2026-09-07" "webpage2pdf 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
webpage2pdf \- turn web pages into clean A4 PDFs that read like typeset essays
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B webpage2pdf
[\fIOPTION\fR]... \fISOURCE\fR...
.br
.B w2p
[\fIOPTION\fR]... \fISOURCE\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B webpage2pdf
works out which part of a web page is actually the article, discards the rest,
and re\-typesets the content for paper.
.PP
Saving a page from a browser keeps the site's screen layout and hands pagination
to an engine that treats page\-break rules as optional, which is why you get
sidebars, cookie banners, and images sliced across two pages. This tool rebuilds
the document instead: it scores every container for prose density, strips the
furniture, normalises the heading hierarchy, caps image heights so no figure can
exceed one page, and renders through WeasyPrint, which enforces
.B break-inside: avoid
rather than treating it as a hint.
.PP
Each \fISOURCE\fR is an http(s) URL or a path to a saved
.I .html
file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " \fIFILE\fR"
Write to this exact path. Accepts a single source only; use
.B \-\-dir
for batches.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-dir " \fIDIR\fR"
Output directory. Filenames are derived from article titles, with
.IR name \-2.pdf ", " name \-3.pdf
used when a name is taken.
.TP
.BR \-\-from\-list " \fIFILE\fR"
Read sources from a text file, one per line. Lines beginning with
.B #
are comments.
.TP
.BR \-\-style " \fINAME\fR"
Stylesheet to typeset with. See
.BR \-\-list\-styles .
Default:
.BR essay .
.TP
.BR \-\-links " \fIplain\fR|\fIendnotes\fR|\fIkeep\fR"
How to treat hyperlinks.
.B plain
strips link styling and is cleanest on paper;
.B endnotes
adds superscript markers and a numbered list at the end;
.B keep
leaves links live. Default:
.BR plain .
.TP
.B \-\-no\-numbering
Omit the automatic section and figure numbers.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-images
Text only. Much smaller files, and faster.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-url ", " \-\-no\-standfirst
Trim the title block: drop the source URL, or the italic summary line.
.TP
.BR \-\-keep\-html " \fIFILE\fR"
Also write the cleaned HTML. Useful for seeing exactly what was removed.
.TP
.BR \-\-timeout " \fISEC\fR"
Network timeout per request. Default: 30.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-styles
Print available stylesheet names and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-doctor
Check the interpreter, native libraries and every Python package, then report
the exact fix for anything missing. Works even when the PDF engine cannot load.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Print errors only.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Convert a single essay:
.B webpage2pdf https://example.com/some\-essay
.TP
A saved file, to a chosen path:
.B w2p saved\-page.html \-o reading/week\-03.pdf
.TP
A batch, named from article titles:
.B w2p url1 url2 saved.html \-d reading/
.TP
A week's reading list, with links collected as endnotes:
.B w2p \-\-from\-list links.txt \-d reading/ \-\-links endnotes
.SH TYPOGRAPHY
Output is A4 with 25mm margins, a serif body justified with hyphenation, and
first\-line indents. The hyphenation dictionary is chosen from the source page's
declared language, so non\-English articles break on the right morpheme
boundaries. Figures are atomic: an image is scaled to fit within a single page
before rendering, and cannot be split from its caption.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I styles/essay.css
The stylesheet. Copy it to
.I styles/<name>.css
and it becomes available as
.BR "\-\-style <name>" .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
All sources converted.
.TP
.B 1
At least one source failed, or the arguments were invalid.
.TP
.B 130
Interrupted.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR webpage2pdf-server (1)
for the local drag\-and\-drop web front end.
.SH BUGS
JavaScript\-rendered and paywalled pages yield little text, because the HTML the
server sends is what gets parsed; no scripts are run. Save such a page from your
browser and convert the file. The tool warns when a result looks suspiciously
thin.
